      "index": 34,
      "text": "Overview"
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "text": "This deliverable outlines the technical design for the PRV-INT-027/ Provider License Interface – Term Date Report. This Package change does/does not require Section 4 based on complexity."
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "text": "This document is prepared by the BI team for review and approved by the Testing team.  It is based on the DSD and contains the specifications and actual logic required to create/Modify the report in COGNOS."
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "text": "Report Details"
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "text": "Report Name: Provider License Interface – Term Date Report"
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "text": "Report Description: To record any Interface errors that occurred during the Common License Interface."
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "text": "Table Used -   P_RPT_CLDI_TERM_TB, R_VV_TB"
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "text": "Report Path: Team content > Operational Reports> Provider>Provider – Scheduled > PRV-INT-027."
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "text": "Output Format: Excel"
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "text": "Script Name: cognosScript_XLSX.sh"
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "text": "CR Enhancement: As part of the OPLC Project, a new report called “Provider License Interface – Term Date Report” is being created. This enhancement also updates the PRV-INT-027 report to capture any interface errors that happen during the Common License Interface process. It includes errors from both OPLC and MMIS data shown in the report."
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "text": "Future State - Report Output"
